<title>UK: Ocean unit completes purchase of waste firm.</title>
<headline>Ocean unit completes purchase of waste firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marine and environmental services company Ocean Group Plc said on Monday its waste management unit Cory Environmental Ltd has completed the purchase of the Waste Company Ltd for approximately 15 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>The acquisition had been accepted by the previous owner, the Gloucestershire County Council, on February 17.</p>
<p>Waste Company was set up in 1992 to manage the county's waste disposal needs.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
